.TH ZIMANYAR-DESKTOP 1 "November 2026" "Zimanyar" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zimanyar-desktop \- check and learn Kurdish as you write
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zimanyar-desktop
.SH DESCRIPTION
Zimanyar finds mistakes in Sorani and Kurmanji as you write, explains each one, and teaches the grammar
behind it. Everything runs on your own computer, and nothing is ever sent anywhere.
.PP
Press Ctrl+Alt+K to check the clipboard from anywhere, where the desktop allows global shortcuts.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/zimanyar/settings.json
Your settings and personal dictionary.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://0xdolan.github.io/Zimanyar/
